"价格为1400万美元，比两周前卖出的球衣更贵。"], "body": "これは1998年のユニフォームです。ジョーダンはこの年、最後のシーズンを戦いました。\n\nジョーダンはこの試合で37点を取りました。そして、6回目の優勝をしました。\n\n値段は14億円でした。", "body_zh": "这是1998年的球衣。乔丹在这一年打完了最后一个赛季。\n\n乔丹在这场比赛中得了37分，并赢得了第六个总冠军。\n\n价格为1400万美元，比两周前卖出的球衣更贵。", "text": "これは1998年のユニフォームです。ジョーダンはこの年、最後のシーズンを戦いました。 ジョーダンはこの試合で37点を取りました。そして、6回目の優勝をしました。 値段は14億円でした。", "vocab": [{"word": "ユニフォーム", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球衣", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "売れる", "pos": "verb", "zh": "卖出", "note": "自动词，表示东西卖出去", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "高い", "pos": "adj", "zh": "高的、贵的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "試合", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "点", "pos": "noun", "zh": "分", "note": "得分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "優勝", "pos": "noun", "zh": "夺冠", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "値段", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "実業家", "pos": "noun", "zh": "实业家", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m", "summary_original": "A Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season sells for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.", "body_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m\nBy\nBen Collins\nBBC Sport journalist\nPublished\n5 hours ago\nA Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season has sold for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.\nJordan wore the Chicago Bulls jersey during game two of the 1998 NBA Finals and has autographed it too.\nHe scored a game-high 37 points that evening before ending his last season with the Bulls with a 4-2 series win for his sixth and final NBA Championship. He was named the Finals' Most Valuable Player in all six.\nThe only item of sports memorabilia that has cost more is the jersey worn by baseball legend Babe Ruth when he \"called the shot\" during the 1932 World Series, which was sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.\nThe previous high for a basketball item was a card featuring Jordan and Kobe Bryant from 2007-08 which\nsold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.\nThe previous record for a piece of game-worn Jordan memorabilia was set just two weeks ago when his jersey from game three of the 1998 Finals, which is not autographed,\nsold via auction for $12.3m (£9.3m).\nThe latest purchase was made by Miami real estate investor Ron Firman in a private sale through Hunt Auctions.\nDavid Hunt, president of Hunt Auctions, said in a statement: \"While Michael Jordan's importance within the sports memorabilia marketplace has long been established, it has now escalated to an elite asset class more typically reserved for iconic works of art.\"\nRelated topics\nBasketball\nMore on this story\nWhy everyone’s talking about The Last Dance\nPublished\n12 May 2020\nMaradona's 'Hand of God' shirt sells for £7.1m\nPublished\n4 May 2022", "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T02:39:12.219452", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "これ", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.425, "sm": 200, "em": 425, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "は", "s": 0.425, "e": 0.575, "sm": 425, "em": 574, "cs": 2, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "1998", "s": 0.575, "e": 2.075, "sm": 574, "em": 2075, "cs": 3, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "年", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.275, "sm": 2075, "em": 2274, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "の", "s": 2.275, "e": 2.375, "sm": 2275, "em": 2375, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "ユニフォーム", "s": 2.375, "e": 2.95, "sm": 2375, "em": 2950, "cs": 9, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "です", "s": 2.95, "e": 3.7, "sm": 2950, "em": 3700, "cs": 15, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "。", "s": 3.7, "e": 3.825, "sm": 3700, "em": 3825, "cs": 17, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "ジョーダン", "s": 3.825, "e": 4.275, "sm": 3825, "em": 4275, "cs": 18, "ce": 23, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "は", "s": 4.275, "e": 4.4, "sm": 4275, "em": 4400, "cs": 23, "ce": 24, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": "この", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.65, "sm"